{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Formerly.</b> In ancient days that have passed, like הפנים (the front), which are the first." "<b>Concerning redemption.</b> If a man redeems or exchanges a field for a field." "<b>And this is the testimony.</b> From the root of עדות (testimony) — concerning this they would testify. Some interpret the word תעודה as custom and practice. And the first is correct."], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:37.519560199Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}